						<leaderTitleFemale>Moral Gun</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Persecuted and imprisoned, Archie 'Toast' Carter boiled with rage. She escaped, formed her gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from her. One day while walking the streets, Toast was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Toast went to commune with the animals in the fields and forests, and connected with them as equals.</description>
