						<name>Zoutin Army</name>
						<adjective>Hyper-Theric</adjective>
						<memberName>Hyper-Therist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Great Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Great Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In a world of selfish, violent men abusing all of humanity to fulfil their urges, Vasalo Gago convened a meeting of powerful women and began working to build a better world for all. Gago instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, she used a fertilizer bomb to kill everyone inside. To deepen their understanding, Gago brought her followers together every week to share new chemical-inducted mental states.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In a world of selfish, violent men abusing all of humanity to fulfil their urges, Vasalo Gago convened a meeting of powerful women and began working to build a better world for all. Gago instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, she used a fertilizer bomb to kill everyone inside. To deepen their understanding, Gago brought her followers together every week to share new chemical-inducted mental states.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>Eagle</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Olive</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.850, 0.405, 0.405, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
